{
  "contract": "intelimensa-accounts-api-v1",
  "description": "Shared fixture for the accounts server's JSON API (auth, manufacturing, update check, device registration, config delivery and config publishing). Owner: accounts repo (testdata/api-vectors.json); copies elsewhere must be byte-identical (sync-vectors.sh). `examples`: JSON on the wire. The server must read every `request` into its record and write every `response` back out identically (nulls kept); a client must write every `request` it sends as given (optional fields may be left out) and read every `response`. Update-check examples carry a `context` (the client's platform, version and trusted key) and the `expect`ed result of AxoSync's check. `tolerated`: JSON a client must still read. `errors`: bodies a client may meet. `rekeyReasons`: the reasons a station may send; anything else is refused.",
  "rekeyReasons": [
    "Reflash",
    "Rework"
  ],
  "examples": [
